  "title": "Jio's IPO and Global Expansion",
  "summary": "India's largest IPO in Jio Platforms and Global IPOs, with Meta- and Google-backed Jio Platforms raising up to $3.2 billion in India's largest IPO, with shares selling at record prices and second largest in dollar terms. This represents a significant investment in Jio's expansion beyond traditional telecom services. Reliance Jio is set to raise ₹13,000 crore through 10-year bonds while Jio Platforms Ltd is expected to seek a valuation of ₹11 trillion in its IPO plan, with the listing expected to begin in October.",
